Syntax-only Symbols:
The following symbols never carry semantic content.

$ OF PLUS MINUS STAR PERCENT UMINUS EOL COLON TITLE LABEL DESCRIBE ASSERT LP
RP DEFINE PRINT COMMA CLASS CHOP WITH AS BEHIND UNTIL EVEN DOT_E HEIGHT
WIDTH RADIUS DIAMETER CW CCW LARROW RARROW LRARROW INVIS THICK THIN SOLID
LJUST RJUST ABOVE BELOW ITALIC BOLD MONO ALIGNED BIG SMALL AND LT GT ON WAY
BETWEEN THE IN THIS DOT_U DIST DOT_XY X Y DOT_L locproperty even document
print prlist pritem prsep attribute_list alist attribute go boolproperty
withclause between
